cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link to https://dhamma.gift."
title: "Dhamma.Gift: the Suttas read by the Suttas' own definitions"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Dhamma.Gift"
    website: "https://dhamma.gift"
    email: "agiftofdhamma@gmail.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://dhamma.gift"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dhammagift/dg-dataset"
abstract: >-
  The Dhamma.Gift project's own Russian translation of the Pali Canon, segment by segment with the Pali root text;
  a glossary of Pali terms with the places where the Suttas define them; and the texts Principles by Suttas and
  Rationale (English and Russian). Every record links to the Pali segment it rests on.
keywords: [pali, pali canon, sutta, vinaya, buddhism, theravada, parallel corpus, glossary, russian]
